This repository is licensed under the MIT licence (see LICENSE). It covers:

- the open-source local MCP client: the leadgen_mcp/ package, scripts/, tests/,
  the Dockerfile and the CI workflow;
- the public description of the Leadgen server: README, server.json,
  glama.json and the skills/ folder.

leadgen_mcp/tools.json is a snapshot of the tool definitions the hosted Leadgen
server publishes (tools/list), included so the client offers the same tools.

The hosted Leadgen server's source code is not part of this repository and is
not licensed here. The client holds no data: it calls Leadgen's public REST API.
The data the server and the API return comes from ONRC, the Ministry of Finance
and ANAF under their own terms (see the README and
https://leadgen.adrianhomelab.com/docs).
